  Finish signing in via your browser

  1. On a remote or headless machine, open this link on another device and
enter the code.

  https://example.com/device

  2. Enter this one-time code after you are signed in (expires in 15
minutes)

  ABCD-EFGH

  Continue only if you started this login in Codex. If a website or another
person gave you this code, cancel.

  Press esc to cancel
